{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just when you thought you were out, we\u2019re pulling you back in, Agent!</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/129f34d6b1da3ff52e602bf87717846b.poster.avif?t=1759936017\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/129f34d6b1da3ff52e602bf87717846b.webm?t=1759936017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/129f34d6b1da3ff52e602bf87717846b.mp4?t=1759936017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Outwit your most cunning adversary to date in the latest installment of this beloved escape room, spy-fi puzzle series. Dr. Roxana Prism, scientist and former Agency inventor, believes she can create a better agent, one that\u2019s superior to our human agents. Wield new gadgets, visit six action-packed locales, and wear custom disguises as you dive back into the world of espionage.<br><br>Protect the Agency and the world as we know it, without losing your wits\u2026or your life! \u2620\ufe0f<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <i>I Expect You To Die 3: Cog in the Machine</i>, you will:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race to Beat Dr. Zor</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/06a4b055839ccd085b75d2602cd0f8a7.poster.avif?t=1759936017\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/06a4b055839ccd085b75d2602cd0f8a7.webm?t=1759936017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/06a4b055839ccd085b75d2602cd0f8a7.mp4?t=1759936017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your assignments take place in some of the most dangerous and expansive locales to date, and each one will require your most advanced covert agent skills. These fast-paced missions will leave you breathless.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet a Brilliant Mastermind</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/69282a1c0ed1333d28af7b2584870ee8.poster.avif?t=1759936017\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/69282a1c0ed1333d28af7b2584870ee8.webm?t=1759936017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/69282a1c0ed1333d28af7b2584870ee8.mp4?t=1759936017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dr. Roxana Prism, scientist and former Agency inventor, believes she can create a better agent, one that\u2019s superior to humans. And she has it out for you, Agent. Your mission: stay alive long enough to defeat this new escalating threat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go Undercover in Style</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/dd05ae377f10ac7af4cf3b5d55b2c3b0.poster.avif?t=1759936017\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/dd05ae377f10ac7af4cf3b5d55b2c3b0.webm?t=1759936017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/dd05ae377f10ac7af4cf3b5d55b2c3b0.mp4?t=1759936017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Show off your style (undercover, of course) with an imaginative array of Agency-approved attire. Look smart and choose your hat, watch, and gloves before embarking on your top-secret missions.<br><br><strong>Join our Discord server for all the latest intel!</strong>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Home is Where the Robot is","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2296380/af7b9ca4f941a56303a72afde368170733bec422.jpg"},{"name":"What's Mine is Mine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2296380/147e8145a3b2fb032ffef49c18f3e4e90f445733.jpg"},{"name":"Construction Ahead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2296380/887540795ed308b27b5d481d0b071fa69a7e9184.jpg"},{"name":"Ollie Ollie Oxen Free","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2296380/17341ff1e00c2f321015d1be50c571027665a45c.jpg"},{"name":"Gondola but Not Forgotten","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2296380/b3d2bae54eb912fc6cdad453f3d7bf87547751ff.jpg"},{"name":"Erupt to No Good","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2296380/f4a2abca342195a2bf8b4a82ff2caba5e8c745de.jpg"},{"name":"Phantom of the Agency","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2296380/2780f490bb252f8fd1a886aba8a9940f19ecfb8a.jpg"},{"name":"Metal Detector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2296380/20dbc8a9783415f08bb573449f5785a7e64ecce3.jpg"},{"name":"Watch Me Run!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2296380/3cb12b74f2aaf57c797c158ccdc6bd691e652c4f.jpg"},{"name":"House Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2296380/179e0354064d21e48dc71d59faea2e594aacb7a8.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2296380?t=1759936017","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759936017","